The shape is a list of 1, 2, 3, and 4.
The lines is 2, while the columns is 2.
The lastline is lines minus 1, while the lastcolumn is columns minus 1.
The area is 0.
For every line from 0 to lastline.
For every column from 0 to lastcolumn.
The cell is line times columns plus column.
The height is item cell of shape.
If height is more than 0, add 2 to area, add height times 4 to area.
If column is less than lastcolumn, The rightheight is item (cell plus 1) of shape, The shared is the smaller of height and rightheight, subtract shared times 2 from area.
If line is less than lastline, The downheight is item (cell plus columns) of shape, The shared is the smaller of height and downheight, subtract shared times 2 from area.

Show area.
